  <item>
    <title>Vol.16 亲密关系之朋友和恋人谁更重要？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/675af86984447b1bd06c024b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">675af86984447b1bd06c024b</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 12 Dec 2024 14:57:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一期6月份录播客了，当时我刚来北京，离开了杭州的朋友们，处在寂寞深渊，成宝也正陷入亲密关系的泥潭里。于是就“朋友”还是“恋人”的这两种亲密关系聊了一些。</span></p><span></span><p><span>可能过了半年，我跟成宝对于当时自己表达的想法有了一些变化，也可能还在坚守一些对亲密关系的原则，一起听听看吧～</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本播客已开通打赏功能，希望大家多多支持～订阅起来！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>姜姜&amp;成宝</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="219">03:39</a> &nbsp;生日Party事件大吐槽，迟到竟只因男嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="359">05:59</a> &nbsp;不同亲密关系催生的分离焦虑，真的色彩各异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="631">10:31</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;让自己更真实的亲密关系，才是更应该被个体维护的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="708">11:48</a> &nbsp;“报备”是信任还是压力，有时候真的说不好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="972">16:12</a> &nbsp;摘掉有色眼睛，没有恋爱脑，只有过于细腻的我们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1067">17:47</a> &nbsp;事件频发，这次不是迟到是爽约，但是她们真的约上么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="859">14:19</a> &nbsp;只要人对了，做什么不重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1151">19:11</a> &nbsp;稳定的亲密关系，是运维的产物还是意志的具像化？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> &nbsp;第三波事件来了：你差点失去我！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1769">29:29</a> &nbsp;在此我郑重承诺…拉勾！上吊！一百年！不许变（有泪目…）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llzAGKY5DDoNjWjl2KUqOoNDxNLx.m4a" length="39583916" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmntAIky_lUqIfnEHTO2zzV9X9E3.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.15 聊聊“好东西”，不仅仅是女性主义</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674490688d1233fb0df9a3c8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674490688d1233fb0df9a3c8</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 25 Nov 2024 15:06:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>看完好东西后的一次大胆尝试，in独自录了一期节目。（一个人说话真的好难！）</span></p><span></span><p><span>聊的都是看完电影很即时性的感受，作为一个剧透恐慌症的严重患者，为了怕剧透，前半部分不涉及剧情细节，大家怕剧透可以看完电影以后再来听后半部分。</span></p><span></span><p><span>录的时候票房还非常不好，排片很差。结果现在已经美美破亿，叫好叫座已成事实。</span></p><span></span><p><span>片名的英译叫Her story, 女性主义的标签已经深深烙上。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但除了这个主题，好东西还聊了一些什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>值得玩味的东西很多，不求面面俱到，内容非常主观，大家随便听听吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个人的播客真的有人听吗？最后播放量2的话我真的会哭。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>in</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为姜姜还没看好东西，但是剪辑是姜姜来剪</span></p><span></span><p><span>为了不剧透剪辑时没有仔细听，所以这一期没有时间轴哦～</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqPl1EAPFvyi4GCOcoqyxxE6Wqcy.m4a" length="42181791" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmntAIky_lUqIfnEHTO2zzV9X9E3.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.14 除了骂麦麦和杨子，再见爱人还有别的观看方式吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6734d15bf373fe5d4d14a235</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6734d15bf373fe5d4d14a235</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Nov 2024 21:28:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>我俩一直是再见爱人的忠实观众，前三季都是追着看过来的。每一季也发了好多微博来讨论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但这一季是in最不喜欢的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>好像从一开始就是骂骂骂，骂个没完。为此我们俩聊着聊着，居然要吵起来了？</span></p><span></span><p><span>in成了渣男烂女的代言人？</span></p><span></span><p><span>麦麦和杨子真的该死吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>该死的人，是不是真的不值得被爱？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们也没有答案。</span></p><span></span><p><span>卢广仲在演唱会结尾的屏幕上打过一句话：</span></p><span></span><p><span>学会爱人，才是大人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>和大家共勉吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>姜姜&amp;in</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> 想看已经离婚的人上再见爱人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="462">07:42</a> 麦琳就和大多数的我们一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> 麦琳是有资格买熏鸡的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1535">25:35</a> 李行亮问题很大，就是又当又立</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1809">30:09</a> 婚姻的本质就很无奈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2144">35:44</a> 留几手就是典型东北男人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2399">39:59</a> 葛夕不要太爱了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2868">47:48</a> 要是我有两个女儿，比麦麦还抠门！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3168">52:48</a> 每周必私信去骂杨子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3297">54:57</a> 黄圣依和杨子就是power couple</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3657">01:00:57</a> 黄圣依没有个人账户说明她是幸福的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4093">01:08:13</a> 作为另一半应该如何回应对方不好的情绪？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4614">01:16:54</a> 处理不好亲密关系的人就应该孤独一辈子吗？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llifMgUuL8A_tkttTCElxGwSToAW.m4a" length="78501951" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:20:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmntAIky_lUqIfnEHTO2zzV9X9E3.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.13 你看过了许多美景，却说不出旅行的意义？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671fa368db74c60aa4de2f9e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671fa368db74c60aa4de2f9e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Oct 2024 15:02:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>刚过去十一假期，去内蒙大玩特玩了好多天，拍了好多美照。</span></p><span></span><p><span>每次旅行结束都需要一段时间来戒断，好像每次出去玩成了日常生活中的一点点盼头。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年剩下可以出游的假期就只有元旦了，那就一边等待下一次旅行，一边来聊聊旅行吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>姜姜 &amp; in &amp; 祝子</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="235">03:55</a> 请假去旅行tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="511">08:31</a> 旅行几个人搭配更合适？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="828">13:48</a> 一下飞机就开始吵架的旅行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1137">18:57</a> 旅行中就是要拍照啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1474">24:34</a> 情侣出游会增进感情吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2008">33:28</a> 旅途中给我有话直说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2105">35:05</a> 选旅伴也是一种学问</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2412">40:12</a> 我们山里出来的孩子就是向往大城市啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2525">42:05</a> 选山还是选海？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2655">44:15</a> 这辈子一定要去的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3107">51:47</a> 追求舒适还是追求新奇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3575">59:35</a> 带父母出游就是next level</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3645">01:00:45</a> 旅行跟阶级有关？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4221">01:10:21</a> 旅行后有变得更好吗？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luzZO_KXK3AJuFXWwCJy2Nuz-2xF.m4a" length="71844824" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:14:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmntAIky_lUqIfnEHTO2zzV9X9E3.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.12 不要到处扣扣，还是花掉所有扣扣？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e0fc52ee04007d88ae8e6b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e0fc52ee04007d88ae8e6b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Sep 2024 02:11:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>众所周知我是一个大财迷，迷恋存钱，迷恋省钱，好想做大富豪哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>可是银行账户里的数字真的可以带来安全感吗？还是带来更多的是焦虑？</span></p><span></span><p><span>月光的朋友看起来每天都很快乐欸，我可以拥有这种快乐吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次我们邀请到的嘉宾，曾经也是花钱大手大脚，现在好像也有些观念的转变。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期和我们一起谈谈存钱，谈谈花钱吧。</span><br><span></span><br><span>【主播&amp;嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>姜姜、in、祝子</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">05:35</a> 第一笔可支配的钱是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="997">16:37</a> 不愿意花的小钱&amp;舍得花的大钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1492">24:52</a> 存钱带来的快乐究竟是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1867">31:07</a> 存一笔钱的目的是花出去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1936">32:16</a> 朋友对金钱观的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3151">52:31</a> 原生家庭对金钱观的影响</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lth07FX56Bc8NI0WAzrFFaUCqElD.m4a" length="69968196" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmntAIky_lUqIfnEHTO2zzV9X9E3.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.11 拒绝眼泪羞耻，那些值得大哭一场的瞬间</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d5d3d15a91beebb34e8c8d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d5d3d15a91beebb34e8c8d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Sep 2024 15:03:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>那天和医生朋友聊天说，我怎么这几年更爱哭了啊，止都止不住。</span></p><span></span><p><span>朋友回我：可能就是单纯地因为泪腺松了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>？？？礼貌吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我知道30+还在有事没事乱哭，真的很不酷。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那我真的就是很不酷啊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>人生真的有好多值得大哭一场的瞬间啊，感动会哭，难过会哭，遇到会哭，错过还是会哭。</span></p><span></span><p><span>笑大部分都可以是假笑。但哭，很难假哭。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不能永远年轻，那就永远热泪盈眶吧。拥抱眼泪，拒绝眼泪羞耻！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>姜姜 、 in</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="179">02:59</a> 年龄大了却更爱哭的残酷事实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="221">03:41</a> 看演唱会止不住地哭！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 哭会让人变得鲜活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="614">10:14</a> 唯一不鼓励哭的情况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1016">16:56</a> 我哭都是因为酒啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a> 那些流过泪的电影电视剧们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1694">28:14</a> 每一次旅行都会哭一次</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2322">38:42</a> 所有的哭都能够被理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2441">40:41</a> 假的东西终将会被真的眼泪所冲掉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2597">43:17</a>拥抱真哭，拒绝眼泪羞耻！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrvh4cipoNaMxkei7PWCqlhMOyfe.m4a" length="43783008" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmntAIky_lUqIfnEHTO2zzV9X9E3.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.10 聊聊工作，是否有一天我们也能跟“周一”和平相处</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66cb5afaead5fc379258831b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66cb5afaead5fc379258831b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 25 Aug 2024 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们谈论过很多工作的细节，那不如先来谈谈工作本身吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>工作是必要的吗？既然这么讨厌周一，我们可以拒绝周一吗？如果不考虑钱的话，我们是否还需要工作？工作和上班是一回事吗？…&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果不想度过周一，那不如在周一听一听我们如何谈论周一。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>姜姜 、 in</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a> 周一上班就是没有好脸色啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="214">03:34</a> 开车上班和地铁上班都一样面如死灰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="436">07:16</a> 工作带来的快乐并不是升职加薪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a> 理想工作到底是怎样的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1214">20:14</a> 工作的意义在于不断突破边界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1747">29:07</a> 薪资作为衡量工作价值的标准应该如何看待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2148">35:48</a> 怎么判断自己是否适合工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2651">44:11</a> 从第一份工作看出如何平衡生活与工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3036">50:36</a> 对下一份工作的愿景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3209">53:29</a> 人生旷野上处处是轨道</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnfZtdvN1cP_-EwQNHQ80QRb7stF.m4a" length="56906405" type="audio/mp4"/>
