  <item>
    <title>Vol.09 怎么这年头还有人北漂啊？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66be20e733591c27be642161</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66be20e733591c27be642161</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 15 Aug 2024 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎in的加入！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是in加入《通通要得》后录制的正式的第一期，我们聊了最近一年彼此的近况，对当下和未来也有一些新的想法。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近一年，姜姜从杭州搬到北京，换了工作，谈了恋爱，好像变了很多，又好像也没变；</span></p><span></span><p><span>in仍然在上海，不再单身也不再为工作焦灼，更多想要珍惜当下。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期只是开胃小菜，后续我们会放大招啦！大家持续关注哦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>姜姜、in</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> 从杭州到北京，到底什么变了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="297">04:57</a> 进了大厂发现，也不过如此嘛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="853">14:13</a> &nbsp;是什么原因让我从杭州搬来北京</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1157">19:17</a> &nbsp;不想跟北京产生太深的联系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1287">21:27</a> &nbsp;在上海生活久了竟然也想离开</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1544">25:44</a> 来北京后碰巧恋爱了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2272">37:52</a> 在上海恢复政治性抑郁的一年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2715">45:15</a> 已经拥有的东西更重要</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ls6Geo66nfjhg6c4IgWDnVuycT3r.m4a" length="47829617" type="audio/mp4"/>
