  <item>
    <title>Vol.07 跑路？转行？那你后悔学建筑吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64d3b2cce490c5dee501541a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64d3b2cce490c5dee501541a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Aug 2023 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>随着建筑行业“世风日下”的大趋势，建筑专业也从往年的高分录取沦落为人人都想提桶跑路的专业了。除了对现实行业的遗憾外，那有真的后悔花5年甚至8年学这个专业吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期邀请到的嘉宾及我个人，都曾对建筑专业爱过，现如今都已跑路转行，欢迎大家随便听听我们对于建筑行业/专业的想法与观点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shawn：建筑学985本科NUS硕士毕业，现互联网大厂运营</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【时间轴】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="159">2:39</a> 十年前和如今的建筑学类报考情况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="448">7:28</a> 想学建筑的原因之一是不用学数学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="793">13:13</a> 建筑人必经的“通宵画图”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="979">16:19</a> 感觉到这专业不太行了的时候</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1211">20:11</a> 建筑专业能学到些什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1445">24:05</a> 当年毕业挤破头进地产工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1626">27:06</a> 从地产转到互联网</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1893">31:33</a> 转行后的过得怎么样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2156">35:56</a> 浅评一下《令人心动的offer建筑季》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2354">39:14</a> 转行后还是会焦虑会迷茫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2465">41:05</a> 有后悔学建筑吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2747">45:47</a> 一些不成熟的转行建议</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ls55PkVNZLeOx0fAW-QmhuNhR25t.m4a" length="48854589" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZnMmlxZUtJdWR3SC01cm1JcmM5TEg1Q01XTk8ucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.06 香港留学，还想再读一次！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64abbdb10c9873af30c9ab02</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64abbdb10c9873af30c9ab02</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Jul 2023 12:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>19年-20年，选择去香港继续读个硕士，于是就遇到了这么一群人。</span></p><p><span>我们一起合租，一起小组作业，一起吃一起玩；</span></p><p><span>那一年，我们经历了很多，因此羁绊也更深了。</span></p><p><span>今年香港通关后，大家又一起重返香港，回忆了一下当年读书的情景。</span></p><h2><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></h2><p><span>ruru/Leo/太阳/屎bb</span></p><h2><span>【时间轴】</span></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a>：本想读书，恰好有特殊经历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a>：选择香港留学的原因 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="422">07:02</a>：重返香港的打车尴尬瞬间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="537">08:57</a>：香港租房是有一些窘迫的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="692">11:32</a>：宣布不用考试时我们竟偷偷掉眼泪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="829">13:49</a>：大家缘起小组作业</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a>：在香港读书和在大陆有什么不同</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">24:33</a>：虽然学制1年，但是真的有学到东西</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1977">32:57</a>：在香港留学最大的收获</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2032">33:52</a>：对香港这个城市的印象</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2301">38:21</a>：如今又回到香港的感受如何？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvcBaNxjZKXPwfazK4Ry9O33BbC4.m4a" length="41659299" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:55</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZyeHFmYmxXTEtvVFlWOTJuc3Mwa1N3cW1uV1oucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.05 精彩人生，我们竟然创业失败过！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/640da83bacc110612a0dcf91</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">640da83bacc110612a0dcf91</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Mar 2023 10:23:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>年轻的时候，我们都是没毕业以及刚毕业的时候，做了一个留学服务公司。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一股子冲劲开启了我们人生中的第一次创业，从有想法到中间执行再到最后打算关门大吉，历经2年的时间我们收获的不仅仅只是一段看起来“失败”的创业经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>想通过这期节目复盘一下我们创业的过程、问题以及收获，最后虽然我们暂时的关门了，但是要得在我们每个人的心里，转化为以后的无数衍生品。</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><h2><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>小孟（又称东莞董明珠）</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【时间轴】</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">03:38</a> &nbsp;看留学服务那么赚钱，我们也开始创业了</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="342">05:42</a> &nbsp;顶峰时期我们公司竟然有100多个人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 一开始创业的目的不是为了赚钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">09:36</a> 那段时间的状态是和平时上班完全不一样的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="879">14:39</a> 创业失败跟赛道、决策、规则及利益分配都有关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1306">21:46</a> 创业初期快速落地重要性大于规则制定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1722">28:42</a> &nbsp;纯线上跨时差协作办公增加了创业难度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2079">34:39</a> 这段创业经历的价值在无限延展中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 东莞董明珠时刻准备着下一次创业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3014">50:14</a> 不要让创业门槛变得太高，创业可太好玩了</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lp3Yi-8pXNu2oRFFpbL3l1xexgI5.m4a" length="58138016" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZqejVDeG1oZmR4N1Q3cWJPbWpnc3M1RUxsYjMucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.04 酒鬼心声：Alcohol save my life</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63fda8bfb91c17e69c765aea</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63fda8bfb91c17e69c765aea</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Feb 2023 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在周五的晚上在朋友家一边喝酒一边畅聊，作为酒鬼的我们为什么那么爱喝酒？又有些什么离谱的醉酒经历？为什么说Alcohol save my life？一起来听听看酒鬼的心声，酒可真是个好东西啊！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>JuJu &amp; CC（两位美女酒鬼）</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【时间轴】</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a> 最近一次喝醉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="297">04:57</a> 过年醉酒被妈妈狂骂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">09:05</a> 喝大到坐救护车竟然要花290块！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="994">16:34</a> 喝上头是能够给我带来快乐的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> 对我来说酒是一种“功能性饮料”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1383">23:03</a> 在家偷爸爸的药酒喝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1632">27:12</a> Helens是我的喝酒启发地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1726">28:46</a> 怎样算一个很好的“酒友”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2024">33:44</a> 喝多了会很经常哭诶！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2440">40:40</a> 喝大后的被路人关心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2572">42:52</a> 判断喝大的标准是是否开始说英语！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3166">52:46</a> 爱酒的是不会抱着目的去喝酒的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3284">54:44</a> 一些躲酒技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4001">66:41</a> 喝大开始唱歌</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvPOUJPkMfeICapHwZQIeuRakT5-.m4a" length="65716238" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:07:43</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZqejVDeG1oZmR4N1Q3cWJPbWpnc3M1RUxsYjMucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.03 三十岁，好像反而不焦虑了？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63e87c700d7e8eaa726e3761</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63e87c700d7e8eaa726e3761</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Feb 2023 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>以前我总是觉得30岁是一个坎儿，会害怕变老，害怕30岁的到来。</span></p><span></span><p><span>现在越来越临近30岁，仍然会偶尔焦虑，但是更多是好奇，还蛮想看看自己30岁是什么样子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次邀请了两位30+的关系好的同事朋友，聊聊他们的生活状态，想看看真正过了30岁的人面对“焦虑”是什么态度。</span></p><span></span><p><span>意外的是，他们反而没有我想象中的那么焦虑，浑身上下就是一个大写的“松弛”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>和他们聊完，好像30岁真的没那么可怕，也没什么好焦虑的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家收听愉快～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>绿子：30+单身女青年（诚招优质男嘉宾）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jasper：看起来比实际年龄小5岁的30+未婚男子</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> 第一次感到年龄焦虑的时候</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">04:23</a> 为什么30多岁的人状态都还蛮好啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> 30多岁面临“催婚”的压力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="614">10:14</a> 焦虑也不一定是坏事啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="687">11:27</a> 焦虑是可以让人成长的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="833">13:53</a> 要学会“拆解”焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1014">16:54</a> 情感上的焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1198">19:58</a> 30多岁的“生育焦虑”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1437">23:57</a> 我不可能这样一辈子上班！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1651">27:31</a> 有在恐惧30岁的到来吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1706">28:26</a> 不同年龄的焦虑都是当时该承受的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1836">30:36</a> 站在20多岁幻想30岁之后的样子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2095">34:55</a> 30岁生日时怎么过的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2274">37:54</a> 如何看待35/40岁的到来？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2393">39:53</a> 30岁之前记得给自己买保险！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkQXYT6GmmSM_vRfb53el5TBH5-D.m4a" length="40698281" type="audio/mp4"/>
