  <item>
    <title>Vol.02 如果重新选择，去大城市还是回老家？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63d7c72a531dadd2b1daf246</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63d7c72a531dadd2b1daf246</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 30 Jan 2023 13:33:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>过年回家见了很多朋友，邀请了几位好友聊一聊关于在大城市还是回老家的事情。</span></p><span></span><p><span>由于春节期间录制地点有限，专门开了一个麻将房录制，特此感谢刘老师倾情赞助房费～</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然已经开始打工了，但是年还没有过完，在这里祝大家新年快乐！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></h2><span></span><p><strong><span>刘老师：</span></strong><span>从重庆回到老家上班的大学老师</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Ben：</span></strong><span>北京工作后裸辞创业选手</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>月亮与篝火：</span></strong><span>毕业后就创业的姐姐</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【时间轴】</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 大城市&amp;老家的浪漫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="388">06:28</a> 回老家后每天都是笑着去上班的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="512">08:32</a> 离家人近是回老家的原因但也因此后悔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> 大城市的开心就好比“约pao”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">17:52</a> 从来没有过“回老家”的念头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1335">22:15</a> 回老家是退路吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1593">26:33</a> 在老家懂得“满足”才是好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1867">31:07</a> 在大城市享受孤独的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> 再选择一次，会选择去大城市还是回老家呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 买不起房是阻碍留在大城市的主要原因吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2661">44:21</a> 租房的生活状态也挺好的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2812">46:52</a> 如果必须回到老家，理想的生活状态是怎样</span></p>]]></description>
